# IMPORTANT: torch and torchvision intentionally use public, platform-
# compatible version ranges rather than CUDA-local `+cu...` pins. Install on
# a CUDA machine with `uv pip install --torch-backend=cu124 -r
# requirements-research.in` (or another backend supported by that machine),
# or use the CPU installation documented in docs/DEPLOYMENT.md. The default
# lock selects published wheels for the host without requiring a local CUDA
# index.
